{
  "answer": "下式的 $\\Delta$ 由解析中的有向回路确定。\n\n$$\\frac{C_{1}}{R_{1}}=\\frac{G_{1} H_{1} \\left(G_{2} G_{4} H_{3} H_{4} + G_{4} H_{4} + 1\\right)}{\\Delta}.$$\n\n$$\\frac{C_{2}}{R_{2}}=\\frac{G_{4} H_{4} \\left(G_{1} G_{3} H_{1} H_{2} + G_{1} H_{1} + 1\\right)}{\\Delta}.$$",
  "explanation": "**从信号图列方程。** 以下增益省略自变量 $s$。求某一外输入的通道时，其余独立输入置零。\n\n$$E_{1}=- C_{1} + R_{1}.$$\n\n$$E_{2}=- C_{2} + R_{2}.$$\n\n$$X_{1}=E_{1} G_{1} + G_{1} G_{3} X_{2}.$$\n\n$$X_{2}=E_{2} G_{4} + G_{2} G_{4} X_{1}.$$\n\n$$U_{1}=C_{2} H_{3} + X_{1}.$$\n\n$$U_{2}=C_{1} H_{2} + X_{2}.$$\n\n$$C_{1}=H_{1} U_{1}.$$\n\n$$C_{2}=H_{4} U_{2}.$$\n\n**逐条核对回路。**\n\n$L_{1}=G_{1} G_{2} G_{3} G_{4}$，对应 $X_{1}\\to X_{2}\\to X_{1}$。\n\n$L_{2}=- G_{1} H_{1}$，对应 $E_{1}\\to X_{1}\\to U_{1}\\to C_{1}\\to E_{1}$。\n\n$L_{3}=- G_{4} H_{4}$，对应 $E_{2}\\to X_{2}\\to U_{2}\\to C_{2}\\to E_{2}$。\n\n$L_{4}=H_{1} H_{2} H_{3} H_{4}$，对应 $U_{1}\\to C_{1}\\to U_{2}\\to C_{2}\\to U_{1}$。\n\n$L_{5}=- G_{1} G_{2} G_{4} H_{1} H_{3} H_{4}$，对应 $E_{1}\\to X_{1}\\to X_{2}\\to U_{2}\\to C_{2}\\to U_{1}\\to C_{1}\\to E_{1}$。\n\n$L_{6}=- G_{1} G_{3} G_{4} H_{1} H_{2} H_{4}$，对应 $E_{2}\\to X_{2}\\to X_{1}\\to U_{1}\\to C_{1}\\to U_{2}\\to C_{2}\\to E_{2}$。\n\n互不接触的回路乘积为 $L_{1} L_{4}$、$L_{2} L_{3}$。\n\n$$\\Delta=1-S_1+S_2.$$\n\n各阶 $S_k$ 是上列每组 $k$ 个互不接触回路的增益乘积之和。$S_1$ 为所有单独回路增益的和。\n\n**$\\frac{C_{1}}{R_{1}}$ 的前向通路。**\n\n$R_{1}\\to E_{1}\\to X_{1}\\to X_{2}\\to U_{2}\\to C_{2}\\to U_{1}\\to C_{1}$ 的增益与余因子为\n$$P_{1}=G_{1} G_{2} G_{4} H_{1} H_{3} H_{4},\\qquad \\Delta_{1}=1.$$\n\n$R_{1}\\to E_{1}\\to X_{1}\\to U_{1}\\to C_{1}$ 的增益与余因子为\n$$P_{2}=G_{1} H_{1},\\qquad \\Delta_{2}=1 - L_{3}.$$\n\n$$\\frac{C_{1}}{R_{1}}=\\frac{P_{1}\\Delta_{1}+P_{2}\\Delta_{2}}{\\Delta}.$$\n\n**$\\frac{C_{2}}{R_{2}}$ 的前向通路。**\n\n$R_{2}\\to E_{2}\\to X_{2}\\to X_{1}\\to U_{1}\\to C_{1}\\to U_{2}\\to C_{2}$ 的增益与余因子为\n$$P_{1}=G_{1} G_{3} G_{4} H_{1} H_{2} H_{4},\\qquad \\Delta_{1}=1.$$\n\n$R_{2}\\to E_{2}\\to X_{2}\\to U_{2}\\to C_{2}$ 的增益与余因子为\n$$P_{2}=G_{4} H_{4},\\qquad \\Delta_{2}=1 - L_{2}.$$\n\n$$\\frac{C_{2}}{R_{2}}=\\frac{P_{1}\\Delta_{1}+P_{2}\\Delta_{2}}{\\Delta}.$$\n\n图中左半段的两条交叉支路用 $G_2,G_3$，右半段用 $H_2,H_3$。两对交叉连接都要保留。多变量求某个通道时只置零未选的外部输入，另一路输出仍参与反馈。",
